OL,3,GNEWSAVirtual reality gives new view of 
OL,4,AScotland's largest PoW camp            
OL,6,FScotland's largest prisoner of war camp
OL,7,Fhas been brought back to life with the 
OL,8,Flaunch of a new virtual reality (VR)   
OL,9,Fexperience.                            
OL,11,FStobs Camp outside Hawick was home to  
OL,12,Fabout 5,000 German prisoners and       
OL,13,Finternees during World War One.        
OL,15,FNow many of the 80 barrack huts,       
OL,16,Fexercise yards and cookhouses have been
OL,17,Frecreated for a seven-minute-long      
OL,18,Fvirtual walk-through.                  
